@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/class-diagram

interface IAssessable
interface IResponse
interface IFeedback

hide empty members

class LtiTool {
    - string clientId
    - uuid deploymentId
}
note bottom of LtiTool
    This class represents a deployment of
    an LTI tool within Schoolbox.

    The tool's clientId and deploymentId
    are used when the student attempts
    the assessment.
end note

class LtiAssessment {
    - string assessmentUrl
    - array customFields
    - ?string lineItemResourceId
    - ?float lineItemMaximumScore
}
note bottom of LtiAssessment
    assessmentUrl, customFields, lineItemResourceId
    and lineItemMaximumScore are populated when the
    selected assessment is returned from the LTI tool.

    These fields will be used to generate the request
    which sends the student to the LTI tool's assessment.
end note

class LtiResponse {}

class LtiFeedback {
    - string normalisedMark
    - string humanReadableMark
}
note bottom of LtiFeedback
    Normalised and HR mark are populated
    from result of GET results request.
end note

IAssessable --|> LtiAssessment
LtiTool -o LtiAssessment
IResponse --|> LtiResponse
IFeedback --|> LtiFeedback

note bottom of LtiResponse
    LTI results don't contain a completion
    state, thus there's no data beyond the
    fields IResponse already prescribes.

    This is still required so that there's a
    record that the student has responded to
    the assessment.
end note

@enduml
